        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>CalculateOffsetsAndStride</name>
        <qualifiedname>AGE::BufferLayout::CalculateOffsetsAndStride</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Calculates the offsets and stride for each element in a container. The function iterates over all elements, setting their offset to the current total offset (which starts at 0), then incrementing the total offset by the size of the current element. It also updates the overall stride which is the sum of sizes of all elements. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>void </para>
</simplesect>
